s://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for 32-bit Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - pre-AppImage \u00b7 SP Flash Tool\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=macos&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# 2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7\n\nKoensayr is a mod for the Y1's OS that makes the following improvements to the original OS:\n\nBrowsing the albums of an artist from Main Menu > Artists > Albums\n\nAdds Bluetooth remote control support and track info displayed on your bluetooth receiver, perfect for using your Y1 in a car with the infotainment system.\n\n\n---\n\n## Build metadata\n\nPatched **rom.zip** built from stock **3.0.7** by [koensayr-auto](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto) v2.4.0.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- Repository: [`y1-community/y1-stock-rom`](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom)\n- Release tag: `Latest-3.0.7`\n- Asset: `rom.zip`\n- Upstream SHA256: `7cbffcbe7dc1beb823e9ab8d37cea6120d16856bba49e02ed2d6e1548832e695`\n\n## Koensayr build\n\n- Version: `2.4.0`\n- Git revision: `16f65333696597b084d34931d4c94f7c5352e9e5` (includes `com.innioasis.y1` APK patches under `src/patches/`)\n\n## Build output\n\n- Patched `rom.zip` SHA256: `b5b8cfbb651460e989a2cfb93a4f9b5e610a76015103e69bac382ba65f9bf97a` (see `build-manifest.json` on this release)\n- Upstream `rom.zip` was re-hashed at build time; output must differ (CI enforces this).\n\n## Patches (`--all`)\n\n- Music-player UX (Artist\u2192Album navigation)\n- Bluetooth pairing (`audio.conf` / `auto_pairing.conf` / `blacklist.conf` / `build.prop`)\n- System config (ADB debugging, bloatware removal)\n- Root (`/system/xbin/su`, mode 06755)\n- AVRCP 1.3 metadata + control + Y1Bridge\n\nDiagnostic scripts (`tools/dual-capture.sh`, gdb attach, `btlog-dump`) are **not** included in the ROM \u2014 see the repo [Diagnostics](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto#diagnostics).\n\n## After flash\n\nIf AVRCP / MultiDex classes fail to load after upgrading from a prior koensayr build:\n\n```bash\nadb shell rm -rf /data/data/com.innioasis.y1/code_cache/secondary-dexes/\n```\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"9c5fab80ba005552154a318e6aa083fb2c6489559c1e4efb7d7a36b1a85bb325\",\"size\":550854730,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"8a4d9201a4ce12a9c7c99d00c34217f8bb7651bfd8649ce4dee3822309f2064b\",\"size\":312615887,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"f72ef5b3d02baf3c03cc3c25babbd9b0d4ea305b99c9b6f75332acd2b45f0d9f\",\"size\":607684334,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"7ae19a1650496ad5e49a2b4583a1399cd3df7bc1e5e573d9f4ad40e9d25d6fe1\",\"size\":432588568,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"fd00dfa437db8747851a3c6bb6413f03f9a3f45b73a008eebc36889ca1b3110d\",\"size\":311030170,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"a612b99471a02c570d37120d43ef1210b35ddc5b515b0fcc54160c6cd6bfe04e\",\"size\":359292333,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:02:15Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1536},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1538},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"cbf737d867a9ce814dfc2a2c51a2ceb308d8e2c477f0d1a595d16710d5ba749f\",\"original_asset_sizes\":{\"build-manifest.json\":545,\"rom.zip\":308982866},\"original_assets\":[\"build-manifest.json\",\"rom.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"build-manifest.json\":14,\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\":1,\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\":1,\"rom-linux.zip\":2,\"rom-macos.zip\":4,\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\":1,\"rom-windows.zip\":2,\"rom.zip\":10},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:02:15Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"driver\":null,\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":364426302,\"tag\":\"2.5.5\"},\"linux-arm64\":{\"driver\":null,\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable-arm64.zip\",\"size\":188443285,\"tag\":\"2.5.5\"},\"linux-legacy\":{\"driver\":null,\"name\":\"flash_tool_linux.zip\",\"size\":73234593,\"tag\":\"flash_tool\"},\"macos\":{\"driver\":null,\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119710372,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"driver\":null,\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip.zip\",\"size\":313278741,\"tag\":\"2.5.4\"},\"windows-legacy\":{\"driver\":{\"digest\":\"sha256:3cf1